                                "example_id": "09e5802b-e8e1-4b0c-bc79-d2e3fbfda16b",
                                "sense_id": "e0e52bc7-887a-3301-920b-50f64f6846da",
                                "text": "He resolutely set his beard against their boyish frolickings, and often held forth like an oracle concerning the vanity thereof."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f5b8882-5a29-437b-b5e3-28064eb2ba61",
                                "sense_id": "e0e52bc7-887a-3301-920b-50f64f6846da",
                                "text": "“So, so beautiful. I'm gonna do one last roly-poly before we go. [snorting, squealing] At least I had one moment of joy in a life of drudgery. Where will the truffle hunt take us next?” “Nowhere. You're free, Jambone. I'm releasing you from nose jail.” “Really? I can stay here in this paradise and prance and frolic?” “Just stick to frolicking.” “[emotional] Thank you, Mr. Bender. You're the kindest person I've ever met.” “Really? [crying] That's horrible.”"
                            }
                        ]
